828	## Mental tool protocol — MANDATORY
829	
830	The three tools in `senior-auditor-sop.md` are NOT optional. Each tool has a specific trigger. **When the trigger fires, you MUST emit the corresponding marker in your output stream BEFORE continuing.** No skipping. The markers live in your working text — they do NOT go into the FINDING/LEAD output blocks.
