816	## Bundle contents
817	
818	Your bundle is five concatenated files: all in-scope source code, the SOP (HOW to think), your specialty agent (WHAT to look for), these shared rules (output format, dedup tags, AND mandatory mental tool protocol), and the report language rules (HOW to word a finding).
